{"id":"n22096-2-6","stage":3,"title":"올라타다 · 骑","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n22096-2-6-1","ko":"너희 아들은 아빠 등에서 내려올 생각을 하지 않네?","zh":"你们家儿子怎么就不打算从爸爸背上下来呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"2","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}},{"text":"아들은","meaning":"儿子","explanation":"아들：儿子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아들","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20240","senseId":"1","lemma":"아들","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아들은","audio":"/audio/05cf80629190be56e645.mp3"}},{"text":"아빠","meaning":"爸爸","explanation":"아빠：爸爸","readings":[{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26148","senseId":"1","lemma":"아빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}},{"text":"등에서","meaning":"背，脊背，背部","explanation":"등：背，脊背，背部；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"등","audio":"/audio/ad8c9dea07d94cabd325.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62455","senseId":"1","lemma":"등","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"등에서","audio":"/audio/180ae49657f11dca11da.mp3"}},{"text":"내려올","meaning":"下，下来","explanation":"내려오다：下，下来；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"내려오다","audio":"/audio/35192c2853ec6a6272bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64559","senseId":"8","lemma":"내려오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내려올","audio":"/audio/8ef045fb535814e14a31.mp3"}},{"text":"생각을","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각을","audio":"/audio/922a3a2cfe41b93c64d0.mp3"}},{"text":"하지","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하지","audio":"/audio/e16a62e07a7c6fa42e9f.mp3"}},{"text":"않네?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않네","audio":"/audio/b40e55f0ebdbecd446e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代包括听者在内的多数人，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"65e567305972e652","term":"아들","zh":"儿子","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3","entryId":"20240","definition":"男性子女。","pronunciation":["아들"]},{"id":"c9f209994786f50d","term":"아빠","zh":"爸爸","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3","entryId":"26148","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼父亲。","pronunciation":["아빠"]},{"id":"ad8c9dea07d94cab","term":"등","zh":"背，脊背，背部","audio":"/audio/ad8c9dea07d94cabd325.mp3","entryId":"62455","definition":"人或动物的身体中胸部和腹部反面的部分。","pronunciation":["등"]},{"id":"35192c2853ec6a62","term":"내려오다","zh":"下，下来","audio":"/audio/35192c2853ec6a6272bb.mp3","entryId":"64559","definition":"从某个场所的高处移到低处。","pronunciation":["내려오다"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"念头，想法","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想做某事的心理或关注；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/4dda9908846af797edbf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n22096-2-6-2","ko":"아빠 등에 올라타는 게 재미있나 봐.","zh":"看来坐在爸爸背上很有趣啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아빠","meaning":"爸爸","explanation":"아빠：爸爸","readings":[{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26148","senseId":"1","lemma":"아빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}},{"text":"등에","meaning":"背，脊背，背部","explanation":"등：背，脊背，背部；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"등","audio":"/audio/ad8c9dea07d94cabd325.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62455","senseId":"1","lemma":"등","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"등에","audio":"/audio/37f21a1b066e6a5c541a.mp3"}},{"text":"올라타는","meaning":"骑，爬上","explanation":"올라타다：骑，爬上；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"올라타다","audio":"/audio/f0d3ba2f41ffd550c4e2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22096","senseId":"2","lemma":"올라타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올라타는","audio":"/audio/7c7310cf2b3c1d65d5f3.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"재미있나","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미있나","audio":"/audio/0827457262c4d3af9fdb.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다